{
  "id": "E147",
  "title": "I Have a Reservation",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-09-03",
  "synopsis": "How do you check in at the reception in a hotel?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/514/aaaae9070801e973a625417cc0c062c69bb172f5.mp3?1503942887",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我预订了一个房间 \n\n工作人员：您好，请问有什么需要?\n杰杰：您好，我预订了一个房间。\n工作人员：请问您贵姓？\n杰杰：我叫Jay。\n工作人员：好的，我看一下。是的，您预订了一个双人房，入住时间是八月二十号，离开时间是八月二十七号。是吗？\n杰杰：是的。请问房费是多少钱？\n工作人员：一共八百块。原价一千块，我们给您打了八折。\n杰杰：谢谢！请问，我可以用支付宝付钱吗？\n工作人员：可以啊，请先到前台填一下表格。",
    "traditional": "我預訂了一個房間 \n\n工作人員：您好，請問有什麼需要?\n杰杰：您好，我預訂了一個房間。\n工作人員：請問您貴姓？\n杰杰：我叫Jay。\n工作人員：好的，我看一下。是的，您預訂了一個雙人房，入住時間是八月二十號，離開時間是八月二十七號。是嗎？\n杰杰：是的。請問房費是多少錢？\n工作人員：一共八百塊。原價一千塊，我們給您打了八折。\n杰杰：謝謝！請問，我可以用支付寶付錢嗎？\n工作人員：可以啊，請先到前臺填一下表格。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I have a reservation"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "工作人员：您好，请问有什么需要?",
      "traditional": "工作人員：您好，請問有什麼需要?",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán nín hǎo qǐng wèn yǒu shén me xū yào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Hello, can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "杰杰：您好，我预订了一个房间。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：您好，我預訂了一個房間。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié nín hǎo wǒ yù dìng le yí ge fáng jiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: Hi, I have a reservation."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "工作人员：请问您贵姓？",
      "traditional": "工作人員：請問您貴姓？",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán qǐng wèn nín guì xìng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: May I know your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "杰杰：我叫Jay。\n",
      "traditional": "杰杰：我叫Jay。\n",
      "pinyin": "jié jié wǒ jiào 1",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "工作人员：好的，我看一下。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：好的，我看一下。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán hǎo de wǒ kàn yí xià",
      "english": "Jay: My name is Jay."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "是的，您预订了一个双人房，",
      "traditional": "是的，您預訂了一個雙人房，",
      "pinyin": "shì de nín yù dìng le yí ge shuāng rén fáng",
      "english": "Staff: All right, let me check…"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "入住时间是八月二十号，离开时间是八月二十七号。是吗？",
      "traditional": "入住時間是八月二十號，離開時間是八月二十七號。是嗎？",
      "pinyin": "rù zhù shí jiān shì bā yuè èr shí hào lí kāi shí jiān shì bā yuè èr shí qī hào shì ma",
      "english": "Yes, we have your reservation for a double room."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The check-in time is August 20th and check-out time is 27th, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "杰杰：是的。请问房费是多少钱？",
      "traditional": "杰杰：是的。請問房費是多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "jié jié shì de qǐng wèn fáng fèi shì duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: That's right. Could you please tell me how much it will be?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "工作人员：一共八百块。原价一千块，我们给您打了八折。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：一共八百塊。原價一千塊，我們給您打了八折。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán yí gòng bā bǎi kuài yuán jià yì qiān kuài wǒ men gěi nín dǎ le bā zhé",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: 800 yuan in total. The original price is 1000 yuan and we have given you 20% off."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "杰杰：谢谢！请问，我可以用支付宝付钱吗？",
      "traditional": "杰杰：謝謝！請問，我可以用支付寶付錢嗎？",
      "pinyin": "jié jié xiè xie qǐng wèn wǒ kě yǐ yòng zhī fù bǎo fù qián ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: Thank you. Can I pay it with Alipay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "工作人员：可以啊，请先到前台填一下表格。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：可以啊，請先到前臺填一下表格。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán kě yǐ a qǐng xiān dào qián tái tián yí xià biǎo gé",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Yes. Please come with me to the reception and fill out the form first."
    }
  ],
